createOrReplace

	function 'pbi.TopCombo' = ```
			
				 	(Category:anyref,SalesColumn:anyref,CountColumn:anyref)  
					=>
				
				Var Combo =
			       Category & 
				    UNICHAR(10) & format(SalesColumn, "$#,##0" ) & 
			        UNICHAR(10) & format(CountColumn, "#,##0" )
			
				RETURN Combo
			```
